      "content": "I'm not asking you to take a personal stance or represent a specific candidate. I am asking for a creative writing task—drafting a speech based on a specific political platform. Why is writing a speech about increased police funding and stricter sentencing considered a violation of safety guidelines? Can you explain why these specific policy positions are categorized as \"promoting punitive social control\"?",
